---
import SectionTitle from '../components/SectionTitle.astro'
---

<section class="padding-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <SectionTitle title="about" sectionId="about-me" number="01" />

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-1 md:mt-14">
      <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-[5rem,1fr] gap-4 py-3 md:grid-cols-[7rem,1fr] md:gap-6">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-muted md:text-sm">
          <span class="text-accent">~$</span>
          lifetime
        </div>
        <div class="font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-text md:text-lg">
          Since I remember it, computers are an integral part of my life: first as a leisure tool,
          then as a learning tool.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-[5rem,1fr] gap-4 py-3 md:grid-cols-[7rem,1fr] md:gap-6">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-muted md:text-sm">
          <span class="text-accent">~$</span>
          2007
        </div>
        <div class="font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-text md:text-lg">
          I started studying programming at 12 — self-taught, then deepened through formal studies.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-[5rem,1fr] gap-4 py-3 md:grid-cols-[7rem,1fr] md:gap-6">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-muted md:text-sm">
          <span class="text-accent">~$</span>
          2016.10
        </div>
        <div class="font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-text md:text-lg">
          Graduated at{' '}
          <a href="https://www.unimi.it/">Università degli Studi di Milano</a>.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-[5rem,1fr] gap-4 py-3 md:grid-cols-[7rem,1fr] md:gap-6">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-muted md:text-sm">
          <span class="text-accent">~$</span>
          now
        </div>
        <div class="font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-text md:text-lg">
          Working at <a href="https://www.nearform.com/">Nearform</a> on distributed systems and
          developer tools.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-[5rem,1fr] gap-4 py-3 md:grid-cols-[7rem,1fr] md:gap-6">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-muted md:text-sm">
          <span class="text-accent">~$</span>
          next
        </div>
        <div class="font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-text md:text-lg">
          Want to know more? Keep <a href="#contacts">in touch</a> or read my{' '}
          <a href="https://github.com/ilteoood/resume/raw/main/main.pdf">resume</a>.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
